'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a set of [[Armor#Heavy-0|Heavy Armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

== Acquisition ==
Both the body armor and [[Armor#Helmet-0|helmet]] can be claimed from the [[Exo Experts Premium Warbond#Page 2|Exo Experts Premium Warbond]] for {{Currency|Medals|55|notext}} and 45 [[Medal]]s, respectively.

